    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Having performed with her parents and acclaimed fiddlers Natalie MacMaster and Donnell Leahy for over 600 shows, genre-defying fiddling (and piano) sensation Mary Frances Leahy is branching out with her fantastic debut solo album First Light.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
